Text_en:
This photo was taken by me three hours before the flight of the #Ukrainian plane at Tehran airport, and now three years after seeing this photo, I just keep silent and cry. Three years have passed and the pain is the same.
#No_to_the_Islamic_Republic #litigation #ps752justice 
@ps752justice

Sheikh Mehdi Karroubi's letter to the experts;

I am amazed at the grave silence of some people in front of all this cruelty and destruction!!! Why is the courthouse of the Islamic system sitting on this black day?
As an observer of #leadership, you daily witness the slaughter of justice in the name of maintaining #power.

